<title>FRANCE: Sanofi says Elf gives it possibilities.</title>
<headline>Sanofi says Elf gives it possibilities.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanofi said an announcement by 53-percent owner Elf Aquitaine that a merger was &quot;desirable&quot; gave it &quot;additional development possibilities for when an opportunity arises,&quot; a spokesman said.</p>
</text>
